#!/bin/csh -f

1) Create source directory
	$INV_HOME_OLD/bin/create_vsab_dirs.pl NCI_<yyyy>_<ver> (e.g. NCI_2018_01E)

2) ftp the data files (meta_export-<ver>.zip) into orig/fromprovider
    a) wget --user=apelon --password="$NCI_FTP_PASSWORD" ftp://lpgftp.nci.nih.gov/evs/apelon/ForMEME/meta_export_17.07e.zip
    b) unzip all files into the orig/fromprovider directory
    c) Included in the zip are 6 data files (*Declaration*txt (4), hierarchy*txt, relations*txt) and ThesaurusInferred.owl. 

3) copy from the previous inversion orig/fromprovider/NCI<ver>.txt (e.g. NCI2025_08D.txt), update it, and then 'cp ../orig/fromprovider/NCI<ver>.txt ../etc'
# this is not actually a required file, but it can help you find out if there
# are any new rels or attributes (the other way to find this out is to have
# someone who is familiar with the NCI side tell you.
# You can diff this file with the previous version, basically the only
# thing that should change is the versions,
# still this is somewhat of a chicken and egg problem, since this information
# needs to be added to /bin/owltotref/evs/nci.config BEFORE the TREF
# files are made

4)  Verify the etc/NCI<ver>.txt file has the <ctrl>VM (end of line) characters removed.

5)  Create sources.src by using dump_src_info.pl and make.sources.src.pl.
        a) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/dump_src_info.pl [-d <db>] [-r <RSAB> | <SAB> | -f<SF>] > template

        b) edit template
        c) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/make.sources.src.pl template > sources.src

6)  Copy over inversion files (src/termgroups, bin/inversion scripts, etc/qa/conservation.txt, etc) from the previous inversion.

7)  Update src/termgroups.src

8)  Update etc/nci.cfg file

9) Create file of relationships with role groups. 
	a) input file (orig/fromprovider/relations-<ver>.txt) contains groups with more than one relationship. For example: 
		C168764|group-92|R177|C101057
		C168764|group-92|R177|C97516
		C168764|group-93|R177|C24601
		C168764|group-93|R177|C99321
	
	b) update file name in bin/create_rolegroups.pl and run
		create_rolegroups.pl | sort ../tmp/rolegroups.tmp | uniq -d > ../orig/rels_needing_relgrp.txt 

	c) output file (orig/rels_needing_relgrp.txt) identifies groups with more than one relationship. 
 		C168764|group-92
		C168764|group-93

10) Create TREF files: 
	a) update file names in bin/create_tref.pl 
	b) update bin/get_nci_assoc.pl and get_owl_roles.pl for any new properties.
	c) run bin/create_tref.pl
	d) Confirm  not present tmp/MR*TREF files.
	e) de-dup *TREF files: bin/delete_dup_tref_lines.pl

11) Copy orig/MRDOC.TREF and orig/MRSAB.TREF from previous inversion.
	a) Update version information in MRSAB.TREF
	b) Add new ATNs and RELAs as needed in MRDOC.TREF

12) Update VSAB bin/compare_exportrels2tref.s

12a) Create reports on TREF files (e.g., fs.not.pn.rpt, fn.no.fs.rpt) ***update scripts***
	(a) grep '|NCIPT|' MRCONSO.TREF > FSYN-NCIPT.out
	(a) cd ../orig/rpts.s

13) Confirm all non-ascii characters in *TREF files changed 
	a) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/charfreq.pl -8 ../orig/*TREF
	b) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/show-examples.pl -c U+00E9 ../orig/*TREF

14) Run bin/tref_2_relational_files.pl

15) Update and run /local/content/MEME/MEME5/inv/archive/projects/TDE_QA/checkall-qual.csh 

16) echo "beginning inversion"
		a) if new subsources or attributes, update invert_NCI.pl
		b) run 'nohup invert_NCI.pl >! invert.log &'

17) echo "creating MRDOC.RRF"
		a) $INV_HOME/bin/makeDoc.pl 

18) echo "running QA"
		a) cd ../src
		b) nohup $INV_HOME/bin/srcQa.pl -c ../etc/*cfg
		c) $INV_HOME/bin/findQaStats.pl

19) No default STYs needed.

20) Perform conservation of mass.

21) Update the etc/si_proposal_<ver>.txt.

22) Ftp to ncicbftp2.nci.nih.gov the orig/NCI2025_<ver>.txt file.
	a) place in directory /evs/apelon/ForMEME/archive
	b) move the previous NCI*txt file to the archive folder.

23) Email Lori Whiteman a summary of the inversion describing any data issues 
encountered and the resolution. Attach a copy of /local/content/MEME/MEME5/inv/archive/projects/TDE_QA/checklist-report-2509E.txt.

24) Send out the inversion source tracking email indicating inversion is 
complete to WCI and NCI.

25) After insertion is complete and the following month's source data arrives, 
archive the previous month's inversion files to s3 using 
'push_s3.csh inv <vsab>'.
